{
  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "C-0001",
      "text": "The synthesis pipeline realizes six phases \u2014 Extractor, Grapher, Critic, Decision Framer, Constraint/Substrate, and Synthesizer \u2014 using only Claude Code primitives.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0002",
      "text": "Long-running, deterministic, multi-tenant production execution is out of scope and belongs on a different substrate such as LangGraph, Temporal, or Step Functions.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "Out-of-scope statement"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0003",
      "text": "Deterministic replay is out of scope because Claude Code is non-deterministic; re-runs use the same prompts but produce variant text.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0004",
      "text": "The slash command /synthesize is a thin entry point that captures an optional topic slug or --resume run-id argument and directs the main agent to load and execute the synthesize skill.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0005",
      "text": "The slash command pattern matches tell-microsoft-joke.md at /mnt/user-config/.claude/commands/.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "Pattern validation marked \u2705"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0006",
      "text": "On invocation, the orchestrator derives a run-id of the form <topic-slug>-<YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS> as the working-directory key.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0007",
      "text": "Input discovery uses Glob output/**/*.md for prior research reports, with paths matching output/synthesis-*/ skipped to prevent recursion.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "Recursion-safety rule"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0008",
      "text": "The Confirmation Gate is a required AskUserQuestion interrupt before Phase 1 with three concurrent questions on a single card: input set, target substrate, and hard constraints.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0009",
      "text": "If the user dismisses the Confirmation Gate card with empty answers, the orchestrator acknowledges and exits without proceeding under assumed defaults.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "Cancellation handling"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0010",
      "text": "Confirmed inputs and constraints are persisted to working/synthesis/<run-id>/00-manifest.json as the durable record every downstream phase reads.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0011",
      "text": "The orchestrator passes only the run-id and the previous-phase artifact path to phase agents, not the contents, to preserve context budget.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "Context-isolation principle"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0012",
      "text": "On --resume <run-id>, the orchestrator reads checkpoint.json and skips to the next phase; the manifest is not re-confirmed on resume.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0013",
      "text": "The orchestrator allows at most one Critic-driven retry of Extractor and at most one Substrate-driven retry of Framer.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "Bounded iteration"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0014",
      "text": "User-defined agents are placed at /mnt/user-config/.claude/agents/<name>.md with frontmatter fields name, description, model, tools, and skills.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "medium",
      "notes": "Marked \u26a0\ufe0f documented-not-locally-verified \u2014 confirm before implementation"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0015",
      "text": "The synth-extractor agent's tool allowlist is Read, Glob, Grep, Write, TaskUpdate.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0016",
      "text": "The synth-synthesizer agent cannot fetch sources; its tool allowlist is Read, Write, TaskUpdate.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "Tool-allowlist principle: no agent gets tools it does not need"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0017",
      "text": "The substrate registry is version-pinned with a header such as version: 2026-04-30.1.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0018",
      "text": "The Substrate agent refuses to emit recommendations if the substrate registry is older than a configurable staleness threshold with a default of 90 days.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "Staleness gate"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0019",
      "text": "The input scan is output/**/*.md minus output/synthesis-*/** as a hard rule.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "Recursion-safety hard rule"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0020",
      "text": "The pipeline uses two memory tiers: a main-agent orchestrator memory using MEMORY.md, and a per-sub-agent memory layered on the file system.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0021",
      "text": "Sub-agents do not have a native automatically-loaded memory file; their isolated contexts contain only what the orchestrator passes in plus what they read themselves.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "Marked \ud83d\udd36 engineering proposal"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0022",
      "text": "Knowledge skills are loaded only when the agent reads them, and the agent can choose to load only the references it needs for the current task.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "Context-cost rationale"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0023",
      "text": "Knowledge skills hold curated taxonomies and rubrics that rarely change; sub-agent memories hold learnings that accumulate over runs.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "Routing rule"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0024",
      "text": "The recommended authoring order is to author knowledge skills first, then agent definitions referencing those skills, then let sub-agent memories accumulate organically through real runs without pre-population.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0025",
      "text": "Each Claim record carries an assumed_substrate field that lets the Substrate agent automatically detect when an external claim assumes a different substrate than the team uses.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0026",
      "text": "Critic verdicts take one of four values: verified, unverifiable, contradicted, or single_sourced.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0027",
      "text": "DecisionFrame's blast_radius takes one of four values: component, service, tenant, or org.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/synthesis-pipeline-technical-design.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": "2026-04-30",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0028",
      "text": "The Standards Identification Gate must be performed before any investigation in the technical-designer process.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": null,
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "Process precondition; Required gate per skill"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0029",
      "text": "Project standards are classified as Explicit (documented) or Implicit (observed pattern only).",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": null,
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0030",
      "text": "Implicit standards require user confirmation before design proceeds.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": null,
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0031",
      "text": "Quality assurance mechanisms are recorded in the Design Doc with adopted or noted status.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": null,
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0032",
      "text": "Existing Code Investigation must be performed before Design Doc creation.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": null,
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0033",
      "text": "Similar functionality search uses domain, responsibilities, or configuration patterns as keywords.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": null,
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0034",
      "text": "When similar functionality is found, the existing implementation is used.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": null,
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "Decision rule"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0035",
      "text": "When similar functionality is technical debt, an ADR improvement proposal is created before implementation.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": null,
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0036",
      "text": "Investigation results are always included in the Existing Codebase Analysis section of the Design Doc.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": null,
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0037",
      "text": "The Fact Disposition Table is the single mechanism that binds existing-behavior facts to the design.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": null,
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "Verbatim from source"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0038",
      "text": "Each Fact Disposition Table row carries one of four dispositions: preserve, transform, remove, or out-of-scope.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": null,
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0039",
      "text": "When all four reuse-vs-new criteria are satisfied, the existing data structure is reused.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": null,
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "Decision rule"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0040",
      "text": "When 3 or more reuse-vs-new criteria fail, a new structure is justified.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": null,
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0041",
      "text": "The Agreement Checklist must be performed at the beginning of Design Doc creation.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": null,
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "Marked Most Important in source"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0042",
      "text": "Implementation approach selection runs Phase 1-4 of the implementation-approach skill.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": null,
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0043",
      "text": "Vertical Slice means complete by feature unit with minimal external dependencies and early value delivery.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": null,
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": "Definition"
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0044",
      "text": "Horizontal Slice means implementation by layer with important common foundation and technical consistency priority.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": null,
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0045",
      "text": "Verification Strategy must include target comparison, method, and observable success indicator.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": null,
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0046",
      "text": "An early verification point defines the first thing to verify and how, to confirm the approach is correct before scaling.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": null,
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0047",
      "text": "For replacements or modifications, the early verification point must be an output comparison of at least one representative case.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": null,
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0048",
      "text": "ADRs include decisions, rationale, and principled guidelines.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
      "date": null,
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0049",
      "text": "ADRs exclude schedules, implementation procedures, and specific code.",
      "source_uri": "/mnt/user-data/uploads/technical-designer.md",
      "source_type": "internal_audit",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "claude_code",
